    "text": "Let<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be the solution of the differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
